    {
      "source": "Returns the description. This can be a message source code or a custom text format. Prefer resolving the\n<a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> using a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回描述信息。该描述可以是消息源代码或自定义文本格式。建议优先通过 <a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> 接口，使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a> 类或接口进行解析。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A description of a resource. Resolvable to plain text by using a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "对资源的描述。可通过使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a> 解析为纯文本。",
